From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Patrick Quinn <patrick.jm.quinn@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 06:58:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: pwm: mediatek,mt2712-pwm: Add MT6789

The MT6789 general-purpose PWM has three channels at the second
register layout (channel registers from 0x80 in steps of 0x40, the
26 MHz select at 0x74), so it needs its own compatible.

Signed-off-by: Patrick Quinn <patrick.jm.quinn@gmail.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pwm/mediatek,mt2712-pwm.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pwm/mediatek,mt2712-pwm.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pwm/mediatek,mt2712-pwm.yaml
index fc31758..592cea5 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pwm/mediatek,mt2712-pwm.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pwm/mediatek,mt2712-pwm.yaml
@@ -17,6 +17,7 @@ properties:
     oneOf:
       - enum:
           - mediatek,mt2712-pwm
+          - mediatek,mt6789-pwm
           - mediatek,mt6795-pwm
           - mediatek,mt6991-pwm
           - mediatek,mt7622-pwm
